{{inh+|nb|gmq-mno|jol|t=Christmas}}, from {{inh|nb|non|jól|t=Yule; midwinter festival}}, from {{inh|nb|gem-pro|*jehwlą|t=Yule}}, of uncertain further origin. The modern form reflects influence from {{der|nb|da|jul}}, from {{der|nb|gmq-oda|iul|alt=jūl}}.

